sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Officer as Verifying Officer (Counter B)
    actor Citizen as Citizen at Desk
    participant UI as Officer Portal (Scrutiny)
    participant DocAPI as Next.js API (/api/officer/documents)
    participant FSM as FSM Engine (lib/fsm.ts)
    participant Prisma as Prisma Client (lib/prisma.ts)
    participant DB as Database
    participant Notify as Notification Service

    Citizen->>Officer: Hand over physical original certificates
    Officer->>UI: View applicant documents for ARN
    UI->>DocAPI: GET /api/officer/applications/{id}/documents
    DocAPI->>Prisma: Fetch document list
    Prisma->>DB: Query Document table
    DB-->>Prisma: Document records
    Prisma-->>DocAPI: Return proofs
    DocAPI-->>UI: Display document preview gallery

    loop Scrutinize Each Proof (Address, DOB, Non-ECR)
        Officer->>Officer: Verify physical original matches digital scan
        alt Deficient or Illegible Proof
            Officer->>UI: Mark CORRECTION_REQUIRED with remarks
            UI->>DocAPI: PATCH document { status: CORRECTION_REQUIRED }
            DocAPI->>Prisma: Update document status
        else Authentic & Matched
            Officer->>UI: Mark VERIFIED
            UI->>DocAPI: PATCH document { status: VERIFIED }
            DocAPI->>Prisma: Update document status with timestamp
        end
    end

    alt Has Deficient Documents
        Officer->>UI: Submit Clarification Request
        UI->>DocAPI: POST transition -> CLARIFICATION_REQUIRED
        DocAPI->>FSM: Validate transition
        DocAPI->>Prisma: Update Application status
        DocAPI->>Notify: Send SMS/Email to Citizen
        DocAPI-->>UI: Status updated
        UI-->>Officer: Clarification request dispatched
    else All Proofs Verified
        Officer->>UI: Finalize Counter B Approval
        UI->>DocAPI: POST transition -> DOCUMENT_VERIFIED
        DocAPI->>FSM: Validate transition
        DocAPI->>Prisma: Update Application status
        DocAPI-->>UI: Verified successfully

        UI->>DocAPI: Transmit to Police Verification
        DocAPI->>FSM: Transition -> POLICE_VERIFICATION_PENDING
        DocAPI->>Prisma: Create PoliceReport (status: PENDING)
        DocAPI-->>UI: Dossier routed to Police
        UI-->>Officer: Case successfully routed to Police Station
    end
